   "texts": [
    "<h2><strong>更好地选择食物的小窍门</strong></h2>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "cms-Text-"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "俯瞰图：两片带皮的生三文鱼片用盐调味，放在炉灶上的不粘锅中。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<h2>食用负责任采购来源的三文鱼</h2>\n<p>如果三文鱼来自水产养殖管理委员会(ASC)认证的渔场，那么养殖过程的许多方面都会经过独立评估和认证&mdash;&mdash;从如何负责任地采购饲料到渔场如何降低对环境的影响。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content-space/barn-images/F13F6983-F768-44A8-B184A04D38D59CA3/main-v1.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content-space/barn-images/4C862B88-0394-47A7-9E7970DD7A822651/main-v1.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium"
   ],
